cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its benchmark results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "gestalt-core: hybrid-retrieval memory and knowledge tooling for coding agents"
abstract: "A markdown knowledge base for Claude Code and Cursor, searched by SQLite FTS5 BM25 and nomic-embed-text-v1.5 dense vectors fused with reciprocal rank fusion, plus session hooks, skills, rules and an evaluation harness. The repository reports nDCG@10 on BEIR SciFact and NFCorpus with seeded confidence intervals and paired permutation tests."
authors:
  - family-names: Bui
    given-names: Philip
    affiliation: "New York University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/phbui/gestalt-core"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-08"
keywords:
  - agent memory
  - hybrid retrieval
  - reciprocal rank fusion
  - BEIR
  - Claude Code
